      check: "Verify YAWN.bot, run 446, job 103676941773"
      conclusion: failure
      reading: >
        Not this change's failure. Runs 439 through 446, on main and on every
        branch from every session on 2026-09-13, concluded failure three to
        four seconds after starting with no executed steps and no downloadable
        logs; the same job failed identically on main at c5aac40 before this
